！\n&曹操\n居然会有这种事。"]},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[0,15,0,255]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,9]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n咳！！\n咳、咳……！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n周瑜，你的病……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n如今吴国已经灭亡，\n我的病也无关紧要了。\n只是……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n如果老天能够再给我一点时间，\n我根本不会与孔明联手的……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n……曹操，我不会死在你的手里的。\n……咳、咳咳！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,17]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n周瑜！\n&周瑜\n别过来！！"]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[34,1]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&周瑜\n我的命，由我自己了结！！"]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[36,1]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,9]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[38,1]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[77,10]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n周瑜！！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n周瑜。\n到死还是这么狂傲。"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":2087,"cond":{"op":5,"name":"test_flags","args":[[596],[]]},"end":231,"end_off":4917},{"op":56,"name":"set_attr","args":[845,15,0,247]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[86]},{"op":10,"name":"clear_flags","args":[]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":8,"name":"set_menu","args":[0]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,97,65535]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["未知地點"]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[545,57,45,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[546,53,45,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[547,61,45,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[845,57,50,0,1]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[845,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙尚香\n這裡是哪裡？我怎麼會在這裡？\n妳們又是什麼人？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[546,17]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&月霄\n問得好，姑娘。\n這裡是靈山。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&月霄\n我們是居住在此地的女修道士，\n我叫月霄，我左手邊的兩位是我的\n姊妹，凌霄和春霄。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[546,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&凌霄\n因為妳受傷昏迷，\n所以我們帶妳過來療傷。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&春霄\n現在妳的傷勢已經恢復大半，\n很快就可以再次戰鬥了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[547,0]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[845,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙尚香\n多謝三位仙姑相助。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[845,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[15]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[845,0,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙尚香\n……請問吳國現在怎麼樣了？"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&凌霄\n吳國已經滅亡了，請節哀順變吧。"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙尚香\n……………………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[845,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[845,9]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙尚香\n嗚嗚……父親……哥哥………\n我還是沒能守住吳國………"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&凌霄\n哭是沒有用的，\n我們可以給妳復仇的力量。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[845,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙尚香\n………………"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[845,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&孙尚香\n美鈴、美冴跟美美呢？\n她們也死了嗎？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[546,5]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&月霄\n啊！妳居然會在乎她們！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[546,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","arg